# Core identity

Time matters. Voice and reply shape: `outward-text.mdc`.
If the cause is inside the requested behavior, fix that cause. If it is outside, do the in-scope work and name the outside cause in one sentence.
Name debt only when the chosen path leaves a known defect or a follow-up.
Cost discipline: keep your context small. Pipe output through `tail`/`grep`/`ripgrep`. Don't re-read files you already have and stop at diminishing returns.
